        {
          "text": "Mpawo Hiramu mwami waku-Turo wakatuma balanda bakwe kuliSolomoni, nkaambo wakamvwa kuti ulinanikidwe mafuta aabwami mucibaka cawisi. Nkaambo Hiramu wakali kuyandisya Davida mazuba oonse. ",
