        {
          "text": "Ulizi kuti taata Davida wakakacilwa kuyakila izina lya-Jehova Leza wakwe iŋanda, nkaambo kankondo bantu nzibakamubusizya, mane Jehova wakababika kunsi azituta zyamaulu aakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
