        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako ndi mukuyeeya kuyakila izina lya-Jehova Leza wangu iŋanda, mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakaambila Davida taata kuti, Mwana wako ngunjoobika mucibaka cako acuuno cako ngonguwe uuti yakile izina lyangu iŋanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.5",
