        },
        {
          "text": "Lino lailila bantu kuti banditemene misamu yakedari mucilundu ca-Lebano, Balanda bangu bayoogwasya balanda bako, azyakuvola zyabalanda bako njookupa kufumbwa mboamba, nkaambo ulizi kuti taakwe muntu akati kesu uuzi kutema misamu mbuli ba-Sidoni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
